\title{EvoTempo: Covariant Evolutionary Tempo Models}
\description{
Implements the covariant evolutionary tempo model of Budd and Mann (2025) \doi{10.1093/sysbio/syaf020}, in which a heritable log-tempo scales speciation, extinction and character change. A discretized-tempo formulation provides extinction probabilities with extant and fossil sampling, diversity moments and tempo distributions, together with exact forward simulators for discretized and continuous tempo.
